Third-party material

Most icons in icons/<version>/ (the icon sets shared by every library version) come from Lucide
(https://lucide.dev), released under the ISC License: see
icons/<version>/LICENSE-lucide.txt. The font fonts/stack-sans-notch.ttf (Stack Sans Notch,
https://github.com/DylanYoungKoto/Stack-Sans) is used only for the author's signature and keeps its own licence,
the SIL Open Font License 1.1: see fonts/OFL.txt.

Flags in flags/<version>/ come from flag-icons (https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons), MIT License: see
flags/<version>/LICENSE-flag-icons.txt. The world map in maps/<version>/ is derived from world-atlas
(https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas, built from Natural Earth data, which is in the public domain), ISC License: see maps/<version>/LICENSE-world-atlas.txt.
